    "detailed_description": "This is a journey filled with challenges and excitement, where you will face monsters of various forms and defeat them through clever skill casting and strategic choices.<br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Combat Experience: This game focuses on combat, where you will encounter a variety of medium and large monsters. Whether it's close combat or ranged attacks, you need to respond flexibly to emerge victorious in this life-and-death struggle.<br></li><li>Innovative Skill Casting: We use basic shapes (such as triangles, squares, etc.) and body movements to implement skill casting. This unique way of operation will bring you unprecedented fun in the game.<br></li><li>Comprehensive Beginner's Guide: We have designed a comprehensive and detailed beginner's guide mechanism to ensure that you can quickly get started and deeply experience the fun of the game.<br></li><li>Semi-free Exploration: This is a semi-free game where you can choose your own path. Whether it's confronting powerful enemies or searching for hidden secrets, the decision is yours.<br></li><li>Focus Challenge: This game requires a certain level of focus. Only by maintaining high concentration can you survive in battles with monsters.</li></ul><br>We look forward to your joining us on this adventure filled with challenges and fun!",
    "about_the_game": "This is a journey filled with challenges and excitement, where you will face monsters of various forms and defeat them through clever skill casting and strategic choices.<br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Combat Experience: This game focuses on combat, where you will encounter a variety of medium and large monsters. Whether it's close combat or ranged attacks, you need to respond flexibly to emerge victorious in this life-and-death struggle.<br></li><li>Innovative Skill Casting: We use basic shapes (such as triangles, squares, etc.) and body movements to implement skill casting. This unique way of operation will bring you unprecedented fun in the game.<br></li><li>Comprehensive Beginner's Guide: We have designed a comprehensive and detailed beginner's guide mechanism to ensure that you can quickly get started and deeply experience the fun of the game.<br></li><li>Semi-free Exploration: This is a semi-free game where you can choose your own path. Whether it's confronting powerful enemies or searching for hidden secrets, the decision is yours.<br></li><li>Focus Challenge: This game requires a certain level of focus. Only by maintaining high concentration can you survive in battles with monsters.</li></ul><br>We look forward to your joining us on this adventure filled with challenges and fun!",
    "short_description": "Step into an exhilarating fantasy world adventure where you'll confront a series of spine-chilling monsters. In this astonishing VR game, you'll need to maintain unwavering focus, utilizing your unique and powerful skills to defeat these formidable adversaries one by one!",
